# BFD IP-to-country database
# Format: START_INT END_INT CC
# IPv4 addresses converted to integers for binary search.
# Rebuild with: update-ipcountry.sh
#
# This is a sample database for testing. For production use,
# run update-ipcountry.sh to download the full DB-IP Lite dataset.
#
# RFC 5737 test ranges (used by BFD test suite):
# 192.0.2.0/24   = 3221225984-3221226239  (TEST-NET-1)
# 198.51.100.0/24 = 3325256704-3325256959 (TEST-NET-2)
# 203.0.113.0/24  = 3405803776-3405804031 (TEST-NET-3)
3221225984 3221226239 XX
3325256704 3325256959 XX
3405803776 3405804031 XX
